sudoku_attention_distance/
sudoku_attention_evolution/

# Model weights never belong in git (project convention: checkpoints live on
# $SCRATCH and are copied to $OAK by hand when worth keeping). 27 model.pt files
# totalling 267MB were already committed before these patterns existed -- see
# STATUS "Open problems"; they are left tracked rather than untracked here,
# because untracking does not shrink the history and this is the user's call.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.h5

# Dated run-output directories. These are written into the repo working tree
# because $SCRATCH/spin_gnn IS the tree, so each new one needs ignoring.
# Anchored to the root: without the leading slash these also matched
# notebooks/sudoku_*_2026-*/, whose figures a results notebook has to carry.
/sudoku_*_2026-*/
/sudoku_sae_*/
/sudoku_circuits_*/
notebooks/**/page*.png
notebooks/_tokpages/
_smoke_*/
# $HOME/spin_gnn symlinks to $SCRATCH/spin_gnn, so "put it on $SCRATCH" puts it
# in the repo root. Layout smoke tests render pages from fabricated summaries
# and must never be mistaken for a run.
_*_smoke/
